# Soft-wrap prompt text at word boundaries

Consider word-aware visual wrapping in the prompt editor without changing the submitted text.

Suggestions:
- Investigate what ZLE and the current editor can support before introducing a separate editing model.
- Check cursor movement, explicit newlines, long unbroken tokens, Unicode width, and terminal resize.
- Use terminal tests to explore the behavior the user actually sees.

